| fixture.rb:10:8:10:55 | call to update | Identity `extern_uid` is updated by `update` without setting `trusted_extern_uid = false`. A changed SAML extern_uid lets an attacker silently take over the mapped account on the next SAML sign-in. Invalidate trust and send a `saml_extern_uid_changed_email` notification. |
